# Input

```css
@media (min-width:48rem){.length{display:block}}
@media (aspect-ratio:16/9){.ratio{display:block}}
@media (30rem<width<=80rem){.range{display:block}}
@media (min-width:calc(100vw - 1px)){.calculation{display:block}}

```


# Formatted

```css
@media (min-width: 48rem) {
	.length {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) {
	.ratio {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (30rem < width <= 80rem) {
	.range {
		display: block;
	}
}
@media (min-width: calc(100vw - 1px)) {
	.calculation {
		display: block;
	}
}

```
